values ('f3a8d1c2-6e47-4b90-8c15-2d7e0a9b4f31', 'medical-surgical-nursing-i', 'Medical-Surgical Nursing I', 'This course introduces safe, evidence-informed adult medical-surgical nursing care for common medical and surgical conditions. Students integrate focused assessment, pathophysiology, pharmacology, diagnostic data, clinical judgment, patient education, interprofessional communication, and care planning. The course emphasizes clinical reasoning, prioritization, deterioration recognition, quality and safety, culturally responsive care, and simulation-based practice.');

