ected findings"}, {"id": "bf6f4c9a-45c2-4ee3-ad76-2c035820309f", "type": "concept", "title": "NCLEX-style prioritization and clinical judgment"}]}, {"id": "64e96cd8-29a6-4db3-a725-e56734a4919e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Communication and documentation", "description": "Clear communication protects patients and makes care visible.", "children": [{"id": "139eca5b-94d4-478d-aed2-87eb18e7710b", "type": "concept", "title": "SBAR and closed-loop communication"}, {"id": "de54c752-98b4-4845-85fb-89f25790356d", "type": "concept", "title": "Nursing notes, care plans, and handoff"}, {"id": "2ae8df3f-7c43-4915-bfbf-59b2d870ed0c", "type": "concept", "title": "Provider notification and escalation documentation"}]}]}, {"id": "729b52ab-aa46-4b36-836e-d01bb4abc867", "type": "topic", "title": "Safety, Infection Prevention, Mobility, Skin Integrity, and Care Transitions", "description": "Students connect fundamentals skills to adult acute-care risks such as falls, infection, pressure injury, and discharge breakdowns.", "children": [{"id": "f1839577-c9de-40f3-a1be-8b337640f627", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Patient safety", "description": "Students learn routines that prevent common inpatient harm.", "children": [{"id": "8fccb5ef-2739-417b-b100-57d0cfc92ed1", "type": "concept", "title": "Fall prevention"}, {"id": "45872502-ec40-48db-82f4-f23eb83d8faa", "type": "concept", "title": "Medication safety and two-identifier checks"}, {"id": "37c2d64d-6a7a-447f-a5b7-588a88348981", "type": "concept", "title": "Restraint alternatives and safe environment"}]}, {"id": "d3db2f52-3b9d-4499-9aa4-05d1b2748eda", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Infection prevention", "description": "Infection control is a daily clinical discipline, not a one-time checklist.", "children": [{"id": "96237a6f-e7f3-4590-960d-f4ea2763a5aa", "type": "concept", "title": "Standard and transmission-based precautions"}, {"id": "0af3c2d3-8654-45da-b86a-6abf65b81d5c", "type": "concept", "title": "Hand hygiene and PPE"}, {"id": "